There are three pillars of data: 
Tabular data- low dimensional, high frequency signals (states, actions, timestamps)
Visual data- frames from the same episode/test are grouped, and videos are shared per camera
metadata- records describing feature names. dtypes, shapes, frame rates, normalization stats, and episode segmentation

