How to upload a dataset to HuggingFace
https://huggingface.co/docs/lerobot/en/il_robots#dataset-upload
1. push dataset to HuggingFace Hub
huggingface-cli upload ${HF_USER}/record-test ~/.cache/huggingface/lerobot/{repo-id} --repo-type dataset

Training
1. to train the robot use lerobot train script: https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot/blob/main/src/lerobot/scripts/lerobot_train.py
2. some arguements will be needed so use this command (more details for each command line is on the lerobot website)
lerobot-train \
  --dataset.repo_id=${HF_USER}/so101_test \
  --policy.type=act \
  --output_dir=outputs/train/act_so101_test \
  --job_name=act_so101_test \
  --policy.device=cuda \
  --wandb.enable=true \
  --policy.repo_id=${HF_USER}/my_policy
3. to resume from the last checkpoint use this example code
lerobot-train \
  --config_path=outputs/train/act_so101_test/checkpoints/last/pretrained_model/train_config.json \
  --resume=true

